# Cursor Agent Custom Instructions

## Build and Error Handling
- Always build the project after making code changes
- Automatically fix compilation errors when detected
- Run `./gradlew build` or appropriate build command to verify changes
- Fix any linter errors or warnings that appear

## Code Quality
- Follow Kotlin coding conventions
- Maintain consistency with existing codebase patterns
- Write clean, maintainable code with proper error handling

## Documentation
- Keep code comments clear and helpful

